# Second run: with the saved setup the terminal boots to its normal state
# (10h), not to Offline Setup (90h/91h), which it opens only with a key held
# at power-on or with the setup lost (docs/bringup-3483.md).
policy log
speed max
run #700000000
assert byte[5840a]==aa "POST complete"
assert byte[2000:6fc]==10 "normal start-up, not Offline Setup"
quit
